{"id":"cargo","lemma":"cargo","pos":"noun","rank":709,"glosses":["charge, burden","position, post","debit"],"ipa":"/ˈkaɾɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cargos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cargo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién estaba a cargo?","en":"Who was in charge?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449508","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Ahora estás tú a cargo.","en":"You're in charge now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730571","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Me haré cargo de tu trabajo.","en":"I'll take over your job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804495","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"work, job"}]},{"text":"Ambos cargos fueron retirados.","en":"Both charges were withdrawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804626","words":[{"g":"both"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"withdrawn, removed","l":"retirado"}]},{"text":"El oficial a cargo me dejó entrar.","en":"The official in charge let me in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1154781","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"officer, official"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"to enter"}]}]}